[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4215237310","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118349#issuecomment-4215237310","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118349","id":4215237310,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc77P2q-","user":{"login":"Altarick","id":52281121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjgxMTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52281121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick","html_url":"https://github.com/Altarick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-04-09T14:59:26Z","updated_at":"2026-04-09T14:59:26Z","body":"Since this modifies only the glsl code, make sure to delete volumetric_fog_process.glsl.gen.h and volumetric_fog.glsl.gen.h by hand AND delete the already existing output binary, or scons will not overwrite them correctly (at least it does not on my machine)","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4215237310/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5385044926","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118349#issuecomment-5385044926","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118349","id":5385044926,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQPlDvg","user":{"login":"dextercodenerd","id":238205331,"node_id":"U_kgDODjK5kw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/238205331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd","html_url":"https://github.com/dextercodenerd","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dextercodenerd/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-08-23T08:24:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-23T08:24:00Z","body":"Any update on this?\r\n\r\nI have hit the same problem, all my low-density fog volumes are yellow because of this. No fog below 0.001 is good for me, because right now I must remove all fog below 0.03. Thanks!","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5385044926/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5939629863","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118349#issuecomment-5939629863","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118349","id":5939629863,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYgePJw","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T20:09:59Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T20:09:59Z","body":"> Tested locally (rebased on top of `master` [12c17c1](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/12c17c187e88efa23e6bbd6689630e256eca6523)) on the MRP from [12c17c1](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/commit/12c17c187e88efa23e6bbd6689630e256eca6523) as well as the TPS and volumetric fog demos, it works as expected. Code looks good to me.\r\n\r\nWhat situations did you test? The biggest risk with this PR is the increase in banding that it causes. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5939629863/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5941079204","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118349#issuecomment-5941079204","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118349","id":5941079204,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYh2spA","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-01T21:33:39Z","updated_at":"2026-10-01T21:35:00Z","body":"> What situations did you test? The biggest risk with this PR is the increase in banding that it causes.\r\n\r\nI ran demos and looked for incorrect colors or banding, but it seemed fine to me. That said, depending on the scene settings, banding may be more noticeable (the MRP is an extreme case of this).\r\n\r\nThis PR limits the precision fog intensity can be *stored* at, but rendering is still as smooth as before, especially if you have viewport debanding enabled. In this example, a NoiseTexture3D is used to modulate density across the volume, and FogVolume's density is set to `0.01`. Each volume is 500×500×500 units, and Environment has the fog length set to 1024 (I increased volume depth to 512 in the project settings to keep a resonable level of precision):\r\n\r\n`master` | This PR\r\n-|-\r\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cd16a40a-36d5-4234-b0d1-cd5113c5bdd8\" /> | <img width=\"3840\" height=\"2160\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e64e6e05-4ce4-4d50-a1a7-f1c9c960baed\" />\r\n\r\nThat said, at very low densities and for large fog volumes, fog will appear to be less strong than before when you're using a texture to modulate its density.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test_volumetric_fog_banding_2.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32935565/test_volumetric_fog_banding_2.zip)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5941079204/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5957272725","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118349#issuecomment-5957272725","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118349","id":5957272725,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABYxTElQ","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-02T16:59:44Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T16:59:44Z","body":"@Calinou You need to test with a volume that has a gradient to see the impact of banding. Sudden colour changes won't show it","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5957272725/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5962934913","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118349#issuecomment-5962934913","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118349","id":5962934913,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABY2sqgQ","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-10-02T23:13:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-02T23:13:43Z","body":"> @Calinou You need to test with a volume that has a gradient to see the impact of banding. Sudden colour changes won't show it\r\n\r\nHere's a video with a gradient density texture, with volume size first set to 64x64 then 512x512. (It's viewed up front with an orthogonal camera.)\r\n\r\n### `master`\r\n\r\n[master.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/60584ade-eb8c-491f-9534-3630d50fc18a)\r\n\r\n### This PR\r\n\r\n[pr.webm](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/467da5bd-f7f9-4a36-9955-543c57f4be97)\r\n\r\nViewport debanding is enabled in the project settings.\r\n\r\n**Testing project:** [test-volumetric-fog-banding.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/32984606/test-volumetric-fog-banding.zip)","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5962934913/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/6002636683","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/118349#issuecomment-6002636683","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/118349","id":6002636683,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABZcj3iw","user":{"login":"Altarick","id":52281121,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyMjgxMTIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52281121?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick","html_url":"https://github.com/Altarick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Altarick/received_events","type"